{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32731","headline":"送薛能少府任盩厔 · 李频","name":"送薛能少府任盩厔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不才甘下第，君子蹇何重。\n相送昆明岸，同看太白峰。\n数瓢留顷刻，残照迫从容。\n好去烟霞县，仙人有旧踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}